# Bird of Prey groups fight on kling4: each hit that lands on a ship with shields up shows the shield hit effect
# around it, and a beam on a ship without shields shows the hull hit sprite. Run it with --map kling4; the README,
# "Run a play script", has the command.
scroll down 20
hold Down 1
hold Up 0.19
wait 0.2
shot fight-1
wait 0.2
shot fight-2
wait 0.2
shot fight-3
wait 0.2
shot fight-4
wait 0.2
shot fight-5
wait 0.2
shot fight-6
wait 0.2
shot fight-7
wait 0.2
shot fight-8
wait 0.2
shot fight-9
wait 0.2
shot fight-10
wait 0.2
shot fight-11
wait 0.2
shot fight-12
wait 0.2
shot fight-13
wait 0.2
shot fight-14
wait 0.2
shot fight-15
wait 0.2
shot fight-16
dump after
